  "headline": "Resolution Is Not Leverage",
  "alternativeHeadline": "Why Raw Model Scale Fails Without Deterministic Architectural Boundaries",
  "description": "Enterprise AI programs routinely conflate higher parameter density and longer context windows with operational leverage. Primary-source engineering analysis demonstrates that leverage comes from deterministic routing, capability-scoped interfaces, and strict boundary hygiene—not brute-force inference resolution.",
